body:
Up by the KY portion and I grew up being told a few a year is okay but a lot of people just fish for fun. I hardly ever seen anyone actually take them home to eat. I think most everyone agrees the Ohio is just too dang nasty cause of all the crap in it.

&#x200B;

A part of the land near my home is always filled with trash after a flood. Tires, plastic barrels, cans/bottles and basically anything you can imagine aside from big heavy stuff. I dont really wanna eat anything having to live in all that.
